  "Connect Antigravity to your Notion workspace with the Notion MCP server, plus skills for research, documentation, meeting prep, specs, trackers, and project updates.": "通过 Notion MCP 服务器把 Antigravity 连接到你的 Notion 工作区，并提供调研、文档、会议准备、需求说明、任务跟踪与项目进展等技能。",
  "Up-to-date documentation lookup. Pull version-specific documentation and code examples directly from source repositories into your LLM context.": "查询最新的文档。直接从源码仓库拉取对应版本的文档和代码示例，注入模型的上下文。",
  "The product development system for teams and agents. Manage issues, projects, and documents across your Linear workspace from Antigravity.": "面向团队与智能体的产品开发系统。可在 Antigravity 中管理 Linear 工作区的问题、项目和文档。",
  "Investigate production issues with real Dynatrace data: problems and root causes, logs, metrics, traces, and vulnerabilities, via skills and the MCP server.": "借助真实的 Dynatrace 数据排查生产问题：通过技能和 MCP 服务器查看故障与根因、日志、指标、链路追踪和漏洞。",
  "Accept payments and grow your business. Stripe's official MCP server enables AI agents to manage customers, products, prices, payment links, invoices, subscriptions, and refunds, as well as search Stripe documentation.": "收款并拓展业务。Stripe 官方 MCP 服务器可让 AI 智能体管理客户、商品、价格、支付链接、发票、订阅和退款，并可检索 Stripe 文档。",
  "Build applications with the Gemini Interactions API and Live API, including text, image, video, and speech generation, managed agents, and real-time multimodal streaming.": "使用 Gemini Interactions API 与 Live API 构建应用，涵盖文本、图像、视频、语音生成，托管智能体以及实时多模态流式交互。",
  "Turn Figma designs into production code, map components with Code Connect, and create or edit Figma files in Antigravity.": "把 Figma 设计稿转换为可上线的代码，用 Code Connect 建立组件映射，并可在 Antigravity 中创建或编辑 Figma 文件。",
  "Give your AI agent 600,000+ real app screens, and the skills to use them. Includes the Mobbin MCP and a skill that redesigns your screen from patterns real apps ship, in your own design system, with the references behind every change.": "为 AI 智能体提供 60 万+ 真实应用界面及其使用技能。包含 Mobbin MCP，以及可参照真实应用的做法、按你的设计系统重绘界面的技能，每处改动都附带参考来源。",
  "Teamwork Graph CLI is Atlassian's agent-first interface to your entire work context: Jira issues, Confluence pages, Bitbucket PRs, along with your connected third-party data sources. Purpose-built for coding agents like Antigravity (terminal or desktop), and powered by Atlassian's context graph. Try: \"draft a Jira issue from this PR and link it to the epic.\" Run /twg-setup after install to connect Atlassian Teamwork Graph CLI to Antigravity.": "Teamwork Graph CLI 是 Atlassian 面向智能体的工作上下文接口，覆盖 Jira 问题、Confluence 页面、Bitbucket 合并请求以及已连接的第三方数据源。专为 Antigravity 这类编码智能体（终端或桌面）打造，由 Atlassian 上下文图谱驱动。可以试试：「根据这个 PR 起草一个 Jira 问题并关联到对应的史诗」。安装后运行 /twg-setup 即可接入 Antigravity。",
  "Connect Antigravity to Dropbox to search, inspect, summarize, share, collect uploads, organize folders, and clean up files with confirmation for write actions.": "把 Antigravity 连接到 Dropbox，用于搜索、查看、汇总、分享、收集上传、整理文件夹和清理文件；写操作会先请求确认。",
  "Plan and track work in monday.com from Antigravity: create, update and assign items, write docs, and build forms that turn requests into items.": "在 Antigravity 中规划和跟踪 monday.com 的工作：创建、更新和分配事项，撰写文档，并搭建把请求转化为事项的表单。",
  "Create and send proposals, quotes, and contracts for e-signature. Track signing progress and identify documents that need follow-up.": "创建并发送方案、报价和合同以供电子签署，跟踪签署进度，并找出需要跟进的文档。",
  "Build and deploy on Netlify: functions, edge functions, blobs, database, identity, forms, image CDN, caching, and AI Gateway, plus the Netlify MCP server.": "在 Netlify 上构建和部署：函数、边缘函数、Blob 存储、数据库、身份认证、表单、图片 CDN、缓存与 AI 网关，并提供 Netlify MCP 服务器。",
  "Deploy, configure, monitor, and troubleshoot apps, databases, and infrastructure on Railway from Antigravity with Railway's agent skill and hosted MCP server.": "借助 Railway 的智能体技能和托管 MCP 服务器，在 Antigravity 中部署、配置、监控和排查 Railway 上的应用、数据库与基础设施。",
  "Build and deploy web apps and AI agents on Vercel with skills for Next.js, AI SDK, and cloud services, plus the official Vercel MCP server.": "在 Vercel 上构建和部署 Web 应用与 AI 智能体，提供 Next.js、AI SDK 和云服务技能，并附带官方 Vercel MCP 服务器。",
  "Build Wix apps and headless sites, and manage Wix stores, bookings, CMS and more, with Wix CLI skills and the official Wix MCP server.": "构建 Wix 应用与无头站点，管理 Wix 商店、预约、CMS 等，提供 Wix CLI 技能和官方 Wix MCP 服务器。",
  "Build, publish, and manage WordPress.com and Jetpack-connected sites. Draft posts, edit blocks, check traffic stats, moderate comments, and manage plugins.": "构建、发布和管理 WordPress.com 及已连接 Jetpack 的站点：起草文章、编辑区块、查看流量统计、审核评论、管理插件。",
  "Add Auth0 authentication to any app: login, MFA, SSO, Organizations, RBAC, custom domains, and branding. Debug auth errors and migrate from other providers.": "为任意应用接入 Auth0 身份验证：登录、多因素认证、单点登录、组织、RBAC、自定义域名和品牌定制。支持排查认证错误并从其他服务商迁移。",
  "Build and deploy Base44 full-stack apps: CLI project management, JavaScript/TypeScript SDK development, and production troubleshooting skills.": "构建并部署 Base44 全栈应用：CLI 项目管理、JavaScript/TypeScript SDK 开发，以及生产环境排查技能。",
  "Give your agent a real browser: navigate, click, type, screenshot, and extract data from any site, locally or on Browserbase cloud browsers.": "为智能体提供真实浏览器：可在本地或 Browserbase 云端浏览器中打开网页、点击、输入、截图，并从任意站点提取数据。",
  "Use the official CrowdStrike-hosted MCP server to work across Falcon: detections, cases, threat intel, SIEM, hosts, vulnerabilities, cloud, and more.": "使用 CrowdStrike 官方托管的 MCP 服务器打通 Falcon：检测、案件、威胁情报、SIEM、主机、漏洞、云环境等。",
  "Manage your Bigin CRM from Antigravity: review pipelines, find contacts and deals, log calls, plan follow-ups, and email customers.": "在 Antigravity 中管理 Bigin 客户关系：查看销售流程、查找联系人和商机、记录通话、安排跟进，并给客户发邮件。",
  "Databricks skills for the CLI, Apps, Lakebase, Model Serving, Lakeflow Jobs, Spark Declarative Pipelines, Declarative Automation Bundles (DABs), and classic-to-serverless migration.": "Databricks 技能集：CLI、Apps、Lakebase、模型服务、Lakeflow 作业、Spark 声明式数据管道、声明式自动化包（DABs），以及从经典集群迁移到无服务器。",
  "Search Intercom conversations, contacts, and companies, spot support trends, and install the Intercom Messenger with secure identity verification.": "搜索 Intercom 的对话、联系人和公司，发现客服趋势，并安装带安全身份验证的 Intercom Messenger。",
  "SEO workflows on live Semrush data: keyword research, site audits, backlinks, competitor, traffic and market analytics, PPC, and AI brand visibility.": "基于实时 Semrush 数据的 SEO 工作流：关键词研究、站点审计、外链、竞品与流量市场分析、付费广告，以及 AI 品牌可见度。",
  "Search and read your Wispr Flow meeting notes, transcripts, scratchpad notes, and calendar events. Read-only access to your own account.": "搜索并阅读 Wispr Flow 的会议记录、转写文本、速记和日历事件。仅以只读方式访问你自己的账户。",
